@startuml
title 29B. App and URL Tracking
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam partition {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
}
|Employee|
start
:Start tracked work;

|Tracking Agent|
:Detect active application;
:Detect active website domain;
:Record usage duration;
:Send usage event;

|System|
:Apply allowlist, blocklist,
and privacy exclusions;
:Associate usage with project and task;
:Aggregate app and website usage;

|Employee|
:View personal usage evidence;
|Manager|
:View authorized team usage summary;
stop
@enduml
